<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan Chinese Petroleum revises prices.</title>
<headline>Taiwan Chinese Petroleum revises prices.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's state-run Chinese Petroleum Corp said on Thursday it revised product prices in September, in U.S. dollars per tonne.</p>
<p>The revised prices will be effective until the end of October.</p>
<p> Product				     September     August</p>
<p> Ethylene					  534	  530</p>
<p> Polymer grade propylene		     423	  420</p>
<p> Chemical grade propylene		    390	  387</p>
<p> Butadiene					 416	  413</p>
<p> Benzene					   316	  287</p>
<p> Paraxylene					468	  496</p>
<p> Orthoxylene				     364	  360</p>
<p> Carbon black feedstock (per kilolitre)  117	  121</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
